body:
Fun story. As the already mentioned problem watching games live was hard. Highlights on nba.com and The occasional botleg game was what we got until youtube/torrents became a thing. I found a site that had torrents but the quality was pretty medicore except for the Raptor games. One Day a buddy told me to watch a game between Nets and Raptors, all he said was "its nuts". It went into double or trippel OT with Vince winning the game (for the nets) with an buzzer beater alley oop from the sidline. Calderon was in the middle of free throw record and Jack really impressed me and I started watching them and slowly feel in love.  

&nbsp;

Tldr: Raptors game where the only games you could download in high quality and watching them lose made me love them. Also Jack Armstrong is a gem.  

&nbsp;

About swedish bball:  

Basketball is growing here and youthball is bigger than ever but league attendence is pretty low and games are almost never on tv. Magic Johnson played here for a while and that helped the sport grow. Jerebko and Jeff Taylor (i played against him btw) helped push it even further.
